  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1129.15 Basis of Accounting. The system for reporting special education costs shall be based on the accrual basis of accounting.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
